    "rating": 4.5,
    "reference": "ChIJXb43H-Y3yUwRNiTSHXa8du8",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Anne Boyko",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118046708122680255502/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVPI4NSQCI4XwJSjM6vmR4N9Pw_qDyav5SuZg9n5HU3i6jvcZ5-TA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Great complete redo kitchen job done by the KSI Team headed by Alice Zhang. Always with a smile, available & responded when needed. The timeline was impressive and the job well done. We would recommend the KSI Team.",
        "time": 1750711756,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Raymond Bujold",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117355038347333617399/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXiaGa_8U3PrpE6bBSQZkMQhhHlLZibIGcv_yPReOW4Er3BggY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I would like to extend my sincere congratulations to KSI Kitchen for their outstanding work in designing, fabricating, and installing our new kitchen and buffet. From our initial visit to the Vaudreuil store and meeting WA, the designer, to their recent follow-up adjusting doors and drawers, every interaction was marked by professionalism.\nThe project was completed on time and within budget, with an installation quality that exceeded our previous experiences. I encourage prospective clients to be prepared, review all details carefully, and ask any necessary questions to ensure a smooth and enjoyable process.\nIn our renovation project, we handled the overall management while KSI was responsible solely for manufacturing the cupboards and counters. The detailed layout plans provided were instrumental in coordinating the remainder of the work efficiently.\nSincerely Raymond & Kelly",
        "time": 1757027640,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ja Wa",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101236700158202149211/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLuLkt9Fot3bNqenvjU8O5UHfKWrO9syBHQ1oys8AZr8eN-NA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Just an update on our situation.\nWe had so many problems with this company  for the past 6 months and was still waiting for the finishing of our kitchen but Kevin came on board and took over. He is very caring and understanding. He got things done and came here himself to complete them. So happy to say our kitchen is finished and we love it. Thank you Kevin.\nI do hope Ruby has learned something from this experience and I do hope when the crew say they are coming. Don’t let us hang around with no one showing up. Our time is important too.\nAlso thank you Ruby for the Cheese board.\nCheers. Janice.",
        "time": 1713454930,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Janice Waterfall",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116020131597773586246/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW1W1V6yniUSbMQPK29TGUyUOr0HaubfostCpZdwg4n9h6ohTo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I would never sign on with this company again. Project Manager, Ruby was great before the contract was signed. After…. Never answered our calls. Never knew when the contractors were coming. Had to be on their back constantly. Sat in the house waiting for someone to show up. Two months of this! Nicked my new floor and never fixed it. Many of our handles separated and marked. Had to watch over everything as many things weren’t done properly. Beware!!!\nBEWARE!!!!! Not a good experience.",
        "time": 1704211685,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ryan Valade",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114265950130235856104/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXqMW1_jZghbaer3WP_tnTi3jBAjJLS_lLjD9m9Lv6fjOXL1gUX=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "After building kitchens at ikea, home depot and Rona we tried KSI. They were very accommodating. Built at high quality real wood kitchen for half the price of the other stores. Alice was our selling agent and was very helpful. The only thing I would say is the instructions to build the cabinets yourself are not the best, so I would just pay the delivery and build costs if you can.",
        "time": 1744253259,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
